<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>Bright.Blue x Pod Foods · Partnership</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,400;0,9..40,500;0,9..40,600;0,9..40,700;1,9..40,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #183EF6;
      --soft-primary: #E8EEFF;
      --primary-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #183EF6 0%, #1E3A8A 100%);
      --bg: #F8FAFC;
      --bg-elevated: #FFFFFF;
      --card: #FFFFFF;
      --card-solid: #FFFFFF;
      --border: #E2E8F0;
      --text: #334155;
      --text-strong: #0F172A;
      --muted: #64748B;
      --muted-2: #94A3B8;
      --radius: 0.75rem;
      --radius-card: 1.25rem;
      --radius-xl: 1.5rem;
      --ease: cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
      --chrome-h: 72px;
      --slide-pad-y: 36px;
      --slide-pad-x: 24px;
      --max: 1180px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 640px) {
      :root {
        --slide-pad-y: 40px;
        --slide-pad-x: 40px;
      }
    }

    @media (min-width: 1024px) {
      :root {
        --slide-pad-y: 48px;
        --slide-pad-x: 56px;
      }
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    html, body {
      height: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      overscroll-behavior: none;
    }

    body {
      font-family: "DM Sans", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-feature-settings: "rlig" 1, "calt" 1;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--bg);
      touch-action: pan-x;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }

    :focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--primary);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

    .brand {
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--text-strong);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .brand .dot { color: var(--primary); }

    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.5vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1.08;
      color: var(--text-strong);
      max-width: 16ch;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 3.6vw, 2.5rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1.15;
      color: var(--text-strong);
      max-width: 26ch;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    h3 {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--text-strong);
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 58ch;
      margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
    }
    .lead-quiet {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      color: var(--muted-2);
      max-width: 52ch;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      display: -webkit-box;
      -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .muted { color: var(--muted); }
    .tabular { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

    .wrap {
      width: min(100% - 2rem, var(--max));
      margin-inline: auto;
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) {
      .wrap { width: min(100% - 3rem, var(--max)); }
    }
    @media (min-width: 1024px) {
      .wrap { width: min(100% - 4rem, var(--max)); }
    }

    .deck {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0 0 var(--chrome-h) 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--bg);
    }

    .deck-track {
      display: flex;
      height: 100%;
      width: 100%;
      transition: transform 420ms var(--ease);
      will-change: transform;
    }

    .slide {
      flex: 0 0 100%;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 0;
      position: relative;
    }

    .slide-inner {
      position: absolute;
      inset: var(--slide-pad-y) var(--slide-pad-x);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .slide-scale {
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: var(--max);
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      transform-origin: top center;
      will-change: transform;
    }

    .slide-scale .wrap,
    .slide-scale .close-inner {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .chrome {
      position: fixed;
      inset: auto 0 0 0;
      z-index: 50;
      height: var(--chrome-h);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      background: #fff;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .chrome-inner {
      width: min(100% - 1.5rem, var(--max));
      margin-inline: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .chrome-center {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 5px;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .chrome-chapter {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--primary);
      line-height: 1;
      min-height: 11px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    .progress {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: nowrap;
      max-width: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 0;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .progress-dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: none;
      padding: 0;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      background: #CBD5E1;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: width 220ms var(--ease), background 220ms var(--ease);
    }

    .progress-dot.active {
      width: 22px;
      background: var(--primary);
    }

    .progress-dot.seen:not(.active) {
      background: rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.35);
    }

    .chrome-meta {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted-2);
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .chrome-meta .curr { color: var(--text-strong); }

    @media (max-width: 639px) {
      .progress { display: none; }
      .chrome-center { gap: 0; }
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      height: 2.75rem;
      padding: 0 1.4rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.975rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity 200ms ease, background 200ms ease, transform 220ms var(--ease), box-shadow 220ms var(--ease);
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }

    .btn:hover { text-decoration: none; }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08), 0 8px 20px rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.18);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.92; }
    .btn-secondary {
      background: #F1F5F9;
      color: var(--text-strong);
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background: #E2E8F0; }
    .btn-ghost {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-strong);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover { background: #F1F5F9; }
    .btn:disabled {
      opacity: 0.35;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      transform: none !important;
    }
    .btn-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.85rem;
      margin-top: 1.75rem;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04), 0 8px 24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
      transition: transform 300ms ease-out, box-shadow 300ms ease-out, border-color 200ms ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      border-color: #CBD5E1;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04), 0 12px 28px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.07);
    }

    .card.is-highlight {
      background: var(--primary-gradient);
      border-color: transparent;
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.22);
    }

    .card.is-highlight h3,
    .card.is-highlight .stat-num,
    .card.is-highlight .stat-label,
    .card.is-highlight p { color: #fff; }

    .card.is-highlight p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.88); }
    .card.is-highlight .step-num { color: #fff; }
    .card.is-highlight .step-sub {
      color: #fff;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.28);
    }

    .card.is-selected {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.25);
    }

    .icon-chip {
      display: flex;
      width: 2.75rem;
      height: 2.75rem;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 0.9rem;
      background: var(--soft-primary);
      color: var(--primary);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .icon-chip svg {
      width: 1.25rem;
      height: 1.25rem;
      stroke: currentColor;
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 1.85;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    .pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.7rem 1.15rem;
      font-size: 0.975rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text-strong);
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.28rem 0.8rem;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--primary);
      background: var(--soft-primary);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.18);
    }

    .banner {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.25);
      background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.07);
      padding: 1.05rem 1.2rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--text-strong);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .banner-primary {
      border: none;
      background: var(--primary-gradient);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1.15rem 1.4rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.2);
    }

    .banner-deep {
      border: 1px solid rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.18);
      background: var(--soft-primary);
      color: var(--text-strong);
    }

    .accent-line {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      font-weight: 650;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--primary);
      max-width: 62ch;
    }

    .grid-2 { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
    @media (min-width: 640px) {
      .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }

    .grid-4 { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
    @media (min-width: 640px) {
      .grid-4 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }
    @media (min-width: 1024px) {
      .grid-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
    }

    .grid-3 { display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
    }

    .mt-4 { margin-top: 1.15rem; }
    .mt-5 { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .card .body {
      margin-top: 0.45rem;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      line-height: 1.45;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; }

    .tile {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .tile::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      width: 3px;
      height: 0;
      background: var(--primary);
      transition: height 480ms var(--ease);
    }
    .js .slide.is-active .tile.is-visible::after { height: 100%; }

    .build-strip {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin: 0.25rem 0 0.75rem;
    }
    .build-item {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--primary);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem;
    }
    .build-item:nth-child(even) { background: var(--text-strong); }

    .unit-stage {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      align-items: center;
    }
      @media (min-width: 900px) {
      .unit-stage { grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; }
    }

    .unit-visual {
      position: relative;
      width: min(100%, 300px);
      aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
      margin-inline: auto;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.18);
    }
    .unit-visual img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }
    .unit-visual figcaption {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0.85rem;
      bottom: 0.7rem;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #fff;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
    }
    .unit-visual::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 60%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.35) 100%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .cap-list { display: grid; gap: 0.65rem; }
    .cap {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      gap: 0.85rem;
      align-items: start;
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .cap-num {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--primary);
      padding-top: 0.15rem;
    }
    .cap h3 { margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
    .cap p {
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0;
    }

    .rev-engine {
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .rev-hub {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.2);
    }
    .rev-hub-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .rev-hub-mark {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    }
    .rev-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    @media (min-width: 640px) {
      .rev-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }
    @media (min-width: 1024px) {
      .rev-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 0.85rem; }
    }
    .rev-item {
      position: relative;
      padding: 1.15rem 1.15rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      min-height: 100%;
    }
    .rev-item::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 1.15rem;
      bottom: 1.15rem;
      width: 3px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--primary);
      transform: scaleY(0);
      transform-origin: top;
      transition: transform 420ms var(--ease);
    }
    .js .slide.is-active .rev-item.is-visible::before { transform: scaleY(1); }
    .rev-num {
      display: block;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
    }
    .rev-item h3 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      padding-left: 0.35rem;
    }
    .rev-item p {
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 0.35rem;
    }
    .rev-loop {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.45rem 0.65rem;
      margin: 1rem 0 0.85rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--soft-primary);
      border: 1px solid rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.14);
    }
    .rev-loop span {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-strong);
    }
    .rev-loop .arrow {
      color: var(--primary);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .path-track {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1.15rem;
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .path-track {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      .path-track::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: 2.1rem;
        left: 12%;
        right: 12%;
        height: 2px;
        background: #E2E8F0;
        z-index: 0;
      }
      .path-track::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: 2.1rem;
        left: 12%;
        width: 0;
        height: 2px;
        background: var(--primary);
        z-index: 1;
        transition: width 900ms var(--ease);
      }
      .js .slide.is-active .path-track.is-drawn::after { width: 76%; }
    }
    .path-track .card { position: relative; z-index: 2; }

    .stack-col .pill {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(12px);
      transition: opacity 380ms var(--ease), transform 380ms var(--ease), border-color 200ms ease;
    }
    .js .slide.is-active .stack-col .pill.is-on {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    .js .slide.is-active .stack-col .pill.is-on:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 60ms; }
    .js .slide.is-active .stack-col .pill.is-on:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 120ms; }
    .js .slide.is-active .stack-col .pill.is-on:nth-child(4) { transition-delay: 180ms; }
    .js .slide.is-active .stack-col .pill.is-on:nth-child(5) { transition-delay: 240ms; }

    #hero {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 55% at 50% 42%, rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.08), transparent 70%),
        var(--bg);
    }

    #hero .slide-scale {
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      width: min(100%, 1000px);
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      transform-origin: center center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    #hero .wrap {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      width: 100%;
    }

    #hero .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    }

    #hero h1 {
      max-width: none;
      margin-inline: auto;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.8vw, 3.6rem);
    }

    @media (min-width: 640px) {
      #hero .hero-line { white-space: nowrap; }
    }

    .hero-brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.4vw, 1.7rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      color: var(--text-strong);
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .hero-brand .dot { color: var(--primary); }
    .hero-brand .x {
      color: var(--muted-2);
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.85em;
    }
    .hero-brand .partner { color: var(--text-strong); }

    .hero-rule {
      width: 48px;
      height: 3px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--primary);
      margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
      transform-origin: center;
    }

    .hero-points {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.55rem 1.25rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      list-style: none;
    }
    .hero-points li {
      position: relative;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-strong);
      padding: 0 0.2rem;
    }
    .hero-points li + li::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: -0.75rem;
      top: 50%;
      width: 4px;
      height: 4px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--primary);
      transform: translateY(-50%);
    }

    .hero-meta {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--muted-2);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .js #hero.hero-loaded .hero-rule {
      animation: rule-draw 520ms var(--ease) 40ms both;
    }
    .js #hero.hero-loaded .hero-brand {
      animation: connect-rise 560ms var(--ease) both;
    }
    .js #hero.hero-loaded .hero-points li {
      opacity: 0;
      animation: connect-rise 480ms var(--ease) forwards;
    }
    .js #hero.hero-loaded .hero-points li:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 280ms; }
    .js #hero.hero-loaded .hero-points li:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 340ms; }
    .js #hero.hero-loaded .hero-points li:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 400ms; }

    @keyframes rule-draw {
      from { transform: scaleX(0); opacity: 0; }
      to { transform: scaleX(1); opacity: 1; }
    }

    .collage-slide {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .collage-head {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    }
    .collage-head .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
    .collage-head h2 {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: none;
      font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3.2vw, 2.15rem);
    }
    .collage-note {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted-2);
      padding-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }
    .collage {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.45fr 1fr 1fr;
      grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 0.55rem;
      width: 100%;
      height: min(58vh, 540px);
      min-height: 280px;
    }
    .collage .c {
      margin: 0;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 0.9rem;
      background: #0F172A;
      min-height: 0;
    }
    .collage .c1 { grid-row: 1 / 3; }
    .collage .c img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      transform: scale(1.06);
      transition: transform 900ms var(--ease), opacity 500ms var(--ease);
      opacity: 0.92;
    }
    .js .slide.is-active .collage .c.is-on img {
      transform: scale(1);
      opacity: 1;
    }
    .collage .c::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 55%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.35) 100%);
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }
    .collage .c figcaption {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0.85rem;
      bottom: 0.7rem;
      z-index: 1;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #fff;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45);
    }
    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .collage {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        grid-template-rows: 1.2fr 1fr 1fr;
        height: min(64vh, 580px);
      }
      .collage .c1 { grid-row: 1; grid-column: 1 / -1; }
      .collage .c5 { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    }

    .stacks {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.15rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      align-items: start;
    }
    @media (min-width: 900px) {
      .stacks {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
        gap: 1.4rem;
      }
    }

    .stack-col h3 { margin-bottom: 0.85rem; font-size: 1.2rem; }
    .stack-col .pill + .pill { margin-top: 0.6rem; }

    .stack-plus {
      width: 3rem;
      height: 3rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0.5rem auto;
      align-self: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.28);
    }
    @media (min-width: 900px) {
      .stack-plus { margin-top: 2.6rem; }
    }

    .pillar-layout {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.15rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    @media (min-width: 960px) {
      .pillar-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr;
        gap: 1.35rem;
      }
    }

    .layer {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 1rem;
      padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(14px);
      transition: opacity 420ms var(--ease), transform 420ms var(--ease), background 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
    }
    .layer:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .js .slide.is-active .layer.is-on {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    .js .slide.is-active .layer.is-on:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0ms; }
    .js .slide.is-active .layer.is-on:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 90ms; }
    .js .slide.is-active .layer.is-on:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 180ms; }
    .js .slide.is-active .layer.is-on:nth-child(4) { transition-delay: 270ms; }
    .layer.is-top {
      background: var(--primary);
      border-color: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.22);
    }
    .layer.is-top .layer-title,
    .layer.is-top .layer-body { color: #fff; }
    .layer-title {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
      color: var(--text-strong);
    }
    .layer-body {
      font-size: 0.975rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .side-panel {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      padding: 1.5rem 1.55rem;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04), 0 8px 24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    }
    .side-panel h3 { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.2rem; }
    .side-panel ul { list-style: none; }
    .side-panel li {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      font-size: 0.975rem;
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .side-panel li::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0.55em;
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--primary);
    }
    .side-panel li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    .timeline-block { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .timeline-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .timeline-label.accent { color: var(--primary); }

    .timeline-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
      border-radius: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.975rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .timeline-bar.trad {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--muted);
      width: 100%;
    }
    .timeline-bar.bb {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      width: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      white-space: nowrap;
      transition: width 700ms var(--ease);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.2);
    }
    .slide.is-active .timeline-bar.bb.is-visible {
      width: min(42%, 100%);
      min-width: min(240px, 100%);
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .slide.is-active .timeline-bar.bb.is-visible {
        width: 100%;
        min-width: 0;
        white-space: normal;
      }
      .timeline-bar { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    }

    .unlock-block {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding-top: 1.35rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .unlock-block h3 { margin-bottom: 0.9rem; font-size: 1.25rem; }
    .unlock-block ul { list-style: none; }
    .unlock-block li {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--text);
      max-width: 62ch;
    }
    .unlock-block li::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0.6em;
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--primary);
    }

    .stat-num {
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      color: var(--primary);
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .stat-label {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-strong);
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }
    .stat-card { min-height: 190px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .stat-card .body { margin-top: auto; font-size: 0.975rem; }

    .vision-close {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--primary);
      max-width: 58ch;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .row {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.55rem 1.15rem;
      padding: 1.15rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      align-items: start;
    }
    .row:first-of-type { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .row {
        grid-template-columns: 2.75rem 1fr 1.45fr;
        align-items: center;
      }
    }
    .row h3 { font-size: 1.125rem; }
    .row p {
      font-size: 0.975rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .own-card ul { list-style: none; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .own-card li {
      position: relative;
      padding-left: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
      font-size: 0.975rem;
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .own-card li::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0.55em;
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--primary);
    }
    .own-card h3 { color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.25rem; }

    .venn {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin: 1.5rem 0 1.15rem;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .venn {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        align-items: center;
      }
    }

    .venn-circle {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-card);
      padding: 1.35rem 1.4rem;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
    }
    .venn-left { background: #F8FAFF; border-color: rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.16); }
    .venn-right { background: #F5F7FC; border-color: rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.16); }
    .venn-circle h3 {
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--text-strong);
    }
    .venn-circle ul { list-style: none; }
    .venn-circle li {
      position: relative;
      font-size: 0.975rem;
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.45;
      padding-left: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
    }
    .venn-circle li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .venn-circle li::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0.55em;
      width: 5px;
      height: 5px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--primary);
    }

    .venn-pill {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.55rem;
      align-self: center;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.22);
    }
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .venn-pill {
        writing-mode: vertical-rl;
        transform: rotate(180deg);
        padding: 1.15rem 0.75rem;
        min-height: 160px;
      }
    }

    .italic-close {
      font-style: italic;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
      max-width: 48ch;
      margin-inline: auto;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .step-num {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .step-sub {
      display: inline-flex;
      margin: 0.4rem 0 0.85rem;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--primary);
      background: var(--soft-primary);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.18);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.28rem 0.75rem;
    }
    .footnote {
      margin-top: 1.15rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .q-row {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.85rem;
      padding: 1.15rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .q-row:first-of-type { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    @media (min-width: 640px) {
      .q-row {
        grid-template-columns: 2.75rem 1fr;
        gap: 1.15rem;
        align-items: start;
      }
    }
    .q-num {
      width: 2.75rem;
      height: 2.75rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(24, 62, 246, 0.2);
    }
    .q-row h3 { font-size: 1.125rem; }
    .q-row p {
      font-size: 0.975rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    #close .close-inner {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .close-headline {
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      max-width: 14ch;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: var(--text-strong);
    }
    .close-sub {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      color: var(--text);
      max-width: 40ch;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .contact-card { max-width: 32rem; }
    .contact-card .name {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-strong);
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }
    .contact-card .role {
      font-size: 0.975rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    }
    .contact-card .next {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .site-footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 1.15rem 0;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .footer-inner {
      width: min(100% - 2rem, var(--max));
      margin-inline: auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .footer-meta {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .js .reveal {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(12px);
      transition: opacity 420ms var(--ease), transform 420ms var(--ease);
      transition-delay: var(--d, 0ms);
    }
    .js .slide.is-active .reveal.is-visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    .js .hero-line {
      display: block;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(16px);
    }
    .hero-line { display: block; }

    .js #hero.hero-loaded .hero-line {
      animation: connect-rise 560ms var(--ease) forwards;
    }
    .js #hero.hero-loaded .hero-line:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0ms; }
    .js #hero.hero-loaded .hero-line:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 80ms; }

    .js .hero-meta {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(12px);
    }
    .js #hero.hero-loaded .hero-meta { animation: connect-rise 560ms var(--ease) 260ms forwards; }

    @keyframes connect-rise {
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .deck-track,
      .progress-dot,
      .timeline-bar.bb,
      .card { transition: none !important; }

      .js .reveal,
      .js .hero-line,
      .js .hero-meta,
      .js .hero-brand,
      .js .hero-rule,
      .js .hero-points li,
      .js .layer,
      .js .stack-col .pill {
        opacity: 1 !important;
        transform: none !important;
        animation: none !important;
      }

      .js .collage .c img {
        opacity: 1 !important;
        transform: none !important;
        transition: none !important;
      }

      .slide.is-active .timeline-bar.bb.is-visible {
        width: min(42%, 100%);
        min-width: min(240px, 100%);
      }
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="deck">
    <div class="deck-track" id="deckTrack">

      <!-- 0 Hero -->
      <section id="hero" class="slide" aria-label="Introduction">
        <div class="slide-inner"><div class="slide-scale"><div class="wrap">
            <div class="hero-brand" aria-label="Bright.Blue and Pod Foods">
              <span>Bright<span class="dot">.</span>Blue</span>
              <span class="x" aria-hidden="true">×</span>
              <span class="partner">Pod Foods</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <p class="eyebrow">PARTNERSHIP INTRODUCTION</p>
            <h1>
              <span class="hero-line">The connected retail platform.</span>
              <span class="hero-line">Built for sell-through.</span>
            </h1>
            <ul class="hero-points" aria-label="What every unit is">
              <li>Store</li>
              <li>Media screen</li>
              <li>Data endpoint</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="hero-meta">Charles McCarty · July 2026 · Confidential</p>
        </div></div></div>
      </section>

      <!-- 1 Network collage -->
      <section id="in-market" data-chapter="01 · Who we are" class="slide" aria-label="In market">
        <div class="slide-inner"><div class="slide-scale"><div class="wrap collage-slide">
            <div class="collage-head reveal">
              <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">01 · IN MARKET</p>
                <h2>Brand endpoints, live in the wild</h2>
              </div>
              <p class="collage-note">Premium venues · Activations · Closed loop</p>
            </div>
            <div class="collage" aria-label="Photo collage of live brand endpoints">
              <figure class="c c1" data-collage>
                <img src="Public/4.jpg" alt="Absolut connected retail unit in a premium lobby" loading="eager">
                <figcaption>Absolut</figcaption>
              </figure>
              <figure class="c c2" data-collage>
                <img src="Public/3.jpg" alt="Porsche Design connected retail storefront" loading="eager">
                <figcaption>Porsche Design</figcaption>
              </figure>
              <figure class="c c3" data-collage>
                <img src="Public/10.jpg" alt="Pepsi brand activation endpoint" loading="eager">
                <figcaption>Pepsi</figcaption>
              </figure>
              <figure class="c c4" data-collage>
                <img src="Public/6.jpg" alt="Suntory brand activation endpoint" loading="eager">
                <figcaption>Suntory</figcaption>
              </figure>
              <figure class="c c5" data-collage>
                <img src="Public/photo_locker_ebayevent_ebay_users.png" alt="eBay Love Island retail activation" loading="eager">
                <figcaption>eBay × Love Island</figcaption>
              </figure>
            </div>
        </div></div></div>
      </section>

      <!-- 2 Who -->
      <section id="who" data-chapter="01 · Who we are" class="slide" aria-label="Who we are">
        <div class="slide-inner"><div class="slide-scale"><div class="wrap">
            <p class="eyebrow reveal">01 · WHO WE ARE</p>
            <h2 class="reveal">Connected retail and retail media, in one network</h2>
            <p class="lead-quiet">Bright.Blue operates a network of connected smart retail units across high-footfall UK venues: airports, gyms and travel hubs. Estate partners include MAG airports, The Gym Group and Snap Fitness. Every unit is a store, a media screen and a data endpoint at once. Brands use the network to launch, sell, advertise and measure in captive environments that traditional retail cannot reach.</p>
            <div class="grid-2 mt-4">
              <article class="card tile reveal">
                <div class="icon-chip" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 21h18"/><path d="M5 21V7l7-4 7 4v14"/><path d="M9 21v-6h6v6"/></svg></div>
                <h3 style="margin-top:0.7rem;">Premium venue estate</h3>
                <p class="body">Airports, gyms and travel hubs, with estate partners including MAG, The Gym Group and Snap Fitness.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="card tile reveal">
                <div class="icon-chip" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2v20"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg></div>
